<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-LANUS BEAT SANTA FE 2-0 IN FIRST LEG OF CONMEBOL FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LANUS BEAT SANTA FE 2-0 IN FIRST LEG OF CONMEBOL FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lanus (Argentina) beat</p>
<p>Santa Fe (Colombia) 2-0 (halftime 1-0) South American Conmebol</p>
<p>Cup final, first leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Oscar Mena (30th, penalty), Ariel Ybazaga (78th)</p>
<p>Second leg to be played on December 4.</p>
</text>
